  "sources": {
    "LJ001-0001": {
      "transcript": "Printing, in the only sense with which we are at present concerned, differs from most if not from all the arts and crafts represented in the Exhibition",
      "normalized": "printing in the only sense with which we are at present concerned differs from most if not from all the arts and crafts represented in the exhibition",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexthink/ljspeech/resolve/7367bcc33648be329bbef057cc97d0b83cadee11/wavs/LJ001-0001.wav",
      "sha256": "4d2bd83ff0f7fe33491b03193abdf623f1b4cc2d8103972b33638d3607d86dc5"
    },
    "LJ001-0004": {
      "transcript": "produced the block books, which were the immediate predecessors of the true printed book,",
      "normalized": "produced the block books which were the immediate predecessors of the true printed book",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexthink/ljspeech/resolve/7367bcc33648be329bbef057cc97d0b83cadee11/wavs/LJ001-0004.wav",
      "sha256": "3c9cce186f26b6690b1d96a6a640c3f1bdb10e1f206738344190fa264955a7af"
    },
    "LJ001-0006": {
      "transcript": "And it is worth mention in passing that, as an example of fine typography,",
      "normalized": "and it is worth mention in passing that as an example of fine typography",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexthink/ljspeech/resolve/7367bcc33648be329bbef057cc97d0b83cadee11/wavs/LJ001-0006.wav",
      "sha256": "4b866eebe1e7cb6ded4bcb27caa0638b8ade67a6a8a2f7132952b716dc7006db"
    },
    "LJ001-0009": {
      "transcript": "Printing, then, for our purpose, may be considered as the art of making books by means of movable types.",
      "normalized": "printing then for our purpose may be considered as the art of making books by means of movable types",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexthink/ljspeech/resolve/7367bcc33648be329bbef057cc97d0b83cadee11/wavs/LJ001-0009.wav",
      "sha256": "d003373f9c769b17995cfff2a99818e720a56f3376678b27fc6c9c27539c3f75"
    },
    "LJ001-0010": {
      "transcript": "Now, as all books not primarily intended as picture-books consist principally of types composed to form letterpress,",
      "normalized": "now as all books not primarily intended as picture books consist principally of types composed to form letterpress",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexthink/ljspeech/resolve/7367bcc33648be329bbef057cc97d0b83cadee11/wavs/LJ001-0010.wav",
      "sha256": "c60d0565bda9ac6076da930bab34d29ea7d1dd8961446b948f73e0a90ccd62de"
    },
    "LJ001-0014": {
      "transcript": "And it was a matter of course that in the Middle Ages, when the craftsmen took care that beautiful form should always be a part of their productions whatever they were,",
      "normalized": "and it was a matter of course that in the middle ages when the craftsmen took care that beautiful form should always be a part of their productions whatever they were",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexthink/ljspeech/resolve/7367bcc33648be329bbef057cc97d0b83cadee11/wavs/LJ001-0014.wav",
      "sha256": "daf5ce9ee3b8b7a38ad7c6ad3ca1d89f88dd216be5f366129f44648f60dd8a9d"
    },
    "LJ001-0180": {
      "transcript": "the proportions of the page still give pleasure by the sense of richness that the cuts and letter together convey.",
      "normalized": "the proportions of the page still give pleasure by the sense of richness that the cuts and letter together convey",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexthink/ljspeech/resolve/7367bcc33648be329bbef057cc97d0b83cadee11/wavs/LJ001-0180.wav",
      "sha256": "cd26fb4fc72988a030e819d7605f403a8f74a3663450ce13be0be3b8ae7e83bc"
    },
    "LJ001-0026": {
      "transcript": "On the whole the type of this book may be considered the ne-plus-ultra of Gothic type,",
      "normalized": "on the whole the type of this book may be considered the ne plus ultra of gothic type",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexthink/ljspeech/resolve/7367bcc33648be329bbef057cc97d0b83cadee11/wavs/LJ001-0026.wav",
      "sha256": "86d8757eaa944031d6ea35bd8b59592e700e3150f59312da9bb7a15f592fc284"
    },
    "LJ001-0048": {
      "transcript": "his letter is admirably clear and regular, but at least as beautiful as any other Roman type.",
      "normalized": "his letter is admirably clear and regular but at least as beautiful as any other roman type",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexthink/ljspeech/resolve/7367bcc33648be329bbef057cc97d0b83cadee11/wavs/LJ001-0048.wav",
      "sha256": "42452973f9f6b82c3a25013c73e0e38a6149a6361f6a5bf72cd68581d002cb7c"
    }
  }
}
